on-arrival: e21_third_done = 1

= To the Masses

The Third Congress of the Communist International sits in Moscow from 22 June to 12 July, in the throne room of the Kremlin. The German question takes more time than any other.

[? if march_action = 1 : Zinoviev and Bukharin defend the March Action as a step forward. Lenin and Trotsky do not. Lenin says that the theory of the offensive is nonsense, and that a party which has not yet won the majority of the working class cannot seize power for it. His slogan for the congress is: to the masses! ?][? if march_action = 0 : Zinoviev and Kun accuse the German Zentrale of passivity: it let Hörsing occupy Mansfeld without a fight. Lenin cuts them short. A party that has not yet won the majority of the working class, he says, must not be provoked into fighting for it. His slogan for the congress is: to the masses! ?][? if march_action = 2 : Zinoviev hails the victory in Central Germany as the first great success of the International in the West. Lenin is more careful. One district is not Germany, he says, and the party must now win the majority of the working class. His slogan for the congress is: to the masses! ?]

[? if e21_levi_fate = 1 : Clara Zetkin pleads for Levi, who has been expelled. Lenin tells her privately that Levi was right about March, and had no right to say so the way he did. ?][? if e21_levi_fate = 2 : Levi's case is on the agenda. Zetkin will plead for him. Lenin has said privately that Levi was right about much, and broke discipline all the same. ?][? if levi_in_party = 1 and e21_levi_fate != 2 : Levi is not on trial here. Some of the Russians wish he were in the German delegation; some are glad he is not. ?]

[? if kapd_exists = 1 : The KAPD delegates are told to merge with us within three months or leave the International. They leave the hall instead. ?]

- @accept: Accept the theses: win the majority first.
- @defend: Defend the March Action.
- @promise: Promise that next time we will fight.
- @plea: Plead for Levi with Lenin.
- @own: Insist that the German party decides for itself.

@accept
subtitle: The Right's line, and Lenin's. Moscow is pleased.
on-arrival: {!
Q.unionist_satisfaction += 10;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 5;
Q.independence -= 4;
Q.moscow_subsidy += 1;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

The German delegation votes for the theses on tactics. The word "offensive" disappears from the Rote Fahne. The word "united front" will soon replace it.

- @verdict: Continue...

@defend
view-if: march_action != 0 and offensive_gone = 0
subtitle: The Left's line. Zinoviev will be grateful; Lenin will remember.
on-arrival: offensive_satisfaction += 10; luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 8; independence -= 2; lean_offensive += 2

The delegates from Berlin defend every day of March. Lenin listens, and in the commission he makes them rewrite their resolution three times.

- @verdict: Continue...

@promise
view-if: march_action = 0 and offensive_gone = 0
subtitle: The Left's answer to Zinoviev. Militancy rises; so does Lenin's eyebrow.
on-arrival: offensive_satisfaction += 8; militancy += 4; luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 5; lean_offensive += 2

The German delegation promises that the next provocation will be answered. Zinoviev applauds. Lenin asks who will do the fighting.

- @verdict: Continue...

@plea
view-if: e21_levi_fate = 1 or e21_levi_fate = 2
subtitle: The Spartacist line. Lenin likes Levi. He likes discipline more.
on-arrival: e21_levi_plea = 1; luxemburgist_satisfaction += 8; offensive_satisfaction -= 6; independence += 2; lean_luxemburgist += 2

Zetkin goes to Lenin's office in the Kremlin with the German delegation's mandate behind her. They talk for two hours.

- @verdict: Continue...

@own
subtitle: The Spartacist line. Moscow's money will be shorter.
on-arrival: {!
Q.independence += 8;
Q.moscow_subsidy = Math.max(0, Q.moscow_subsidy - 1);
Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction += 5;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 5;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 2;
!}

The German delegation accepts the theses but declares that it will apply them as the German party sees fit. Radek calls it a declaration of independence and congratulates them, in private.

- @verdict: Continue...

@verdict
title: The Verdict
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.e21_levi_verdict = 0;
if (Q.e21_levi_fate == 2 && Q.levi_in_party == 1) {
    var p = 20;
    if (Q.e21_levi_plea) { p += 30; }
    p += (Q.independence - 50) / 2;
    p += 2 * ((Q.history_luxemburgist || 0) - (Q.history_offensive || 0));
    if (Q.luxemburg_alive == 1) { p += 20; }
    p = Math.max(5, Math.min(75, p));
    if (100 * Math.random() < p) {
        Q.e21_levi_verdict = 2;
        Q.e21_levi_fate = 5;
        Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction += 8;
        Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 8;
    } else {
        Q.e21_levi_verdict = 1;
        Q.e21_levi_fate = 1;
        Q.levi_in_party = 0;
        Q.levi_split = 1;
        Q.levi_advisor = 0;
        var heir = (Q.leading_faction == 'luxemburgist') ? 'unionist' : Q.leading_faction;
        for (var d of Q.districts) {
            Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.9;
            if (Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] == 'luxemburgist') {
                Q['district_' + d + '_members'] *= 0.7;
                Q['district_' + d + '_faction'] = heir;
                Q['district_' + d + '_loyalty'] = 45;
            }
        }
        if (Q.leading_faction == 'luxemburgist') {
            Q.leading_faction = 'unionist';
            Q.junior_faction = 'offensive';
        }
        Q.luxemburgist_satisfaction -= 15;
        Q.offensive_satisfaction += 6;
    }
} else if (Q.e21_levi_fate == 1) {
    Q.e21_levi_verdict = 3;
}
!}

= The Verdict

The congress adopts Lenin's theses on tactics. The communist parties are to win the majority of the working class before they try to lead it to power. [? if march_action = 1 : The March Action is called a step forward in the resolution and a mistake in every speech. ?]

[? if e21_levi_verdict = 2 : On Levi, the congress decides to censure, not expel. Lenin's formula is that Levi is to be kept, watched and used. Zetkin brings him the news in person. ?][? if e21_levi_verdict = 1 : On Levi, the congress confirms what the Zentrale would not decide: he is expelled for breach of discipline. His friends in the Reichstag group start to talk about leaving with him. ?][? if e21_levi_verdict = 3 and e21_levi_plea = 0 : The congress confirms Levi's expulsion. ?][? if e21_levi_verdict = 3 and e21_levi_plea = 1 : The congress confirms Levi's expulsion. But Lenin agrees with Zetkin that the door may be opened again if Levi submits to the party. Levi has not said he will. ?]

The delegates go home to prepare the party's congress, called for Jena in August.
